.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/forge/
.DS_Store

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local prototypes + diagnostics (generated; not plugin surface).
#
# NOT a blanket ignore any more. `tools/` also holds committed dev-tooling packages
# that CI actually runs (model-measure, harness_audit), so the blanket rule was
# already contradicted by 9 tracked files — and it silently swallowed a NEW package
# on `git add -A`, because a gitignore only applies to untracked paths and therefore
# fails quietly and invisibly for exactly the person adding something. Each committed
# package is un-ignored explicitly; a new one MUST be added here or it will be dropped
# from the commit without a word. (.claude/rules/general.md, silent-skip class.)
tools/*
!tools/model-measure/
!tools/harness_audit/
!tools/doc-fragment/

# Rendered verify-build report (served by .claude/launch.json; regenerated per run)
.flow/
